<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Plastall yr shr rises, to make cap award.</title>
<headline>Plastall yr shr rises, to make cap award.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended Sept 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     30.7	  vs 21.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   4.42	  vs 3.02</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   5.15	  vs 3.05</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.73	  vs 0.03</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   1.55	  vs 1.49</p>
<p>    Turnover		  84.69	 vs 74.01</p>
<p>Full name: Plastall Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said they would award capitalisation shares in the ratio of five shares for every 100 held on December 13, at an issue price of 2.40 rand a share. Shareholders may instead elect to receive a 10.0 cents cash dividend.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
